## A note on the labels

The labels are judgments made by a human and a language model against a versioned
codebook (`docs/codebook-v2.md`), not ground truth. The published set includes the
codebook version, the classifier model and prompt version, and a measured
self-agreement ceiling, so that anyone reusing it can see how much to trust it.
